ts.\n- Confounder controls: the static 2-hop neighbourhood of 798 does connect to 131 through hub 389 (step 03), and 389 is highly active (170 events, step 06) \u2014 the apparent connection is a time-ignoring hub artefact, not a time-respecting path; 798\u2013389 contact does not recur in the later windows where 131 is active (steps 13, 14).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_2025d7ec\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [798, 131, 389, 1932, 972, 1877],\n  \"window\": [4302, 42701],\n  \"confidence\": 0.62,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"798's only outbound contact with the hub 389 occurs around t\u224810300-12300, while 131 can only be entered from 972/1877/1932 (1877 unreachable, 972 only via 1439, 1932 via 6 nodes), so a cascade needs at least four hops. The target-side node set shows at most one event in the 600-unit-chainable band after 798's contact and none after t=11300, so the final hops cannot occur in time; 131's own activity begins ~14000+ and is far outside the 600-unit gap limit. The static 798-389-131 connection and 389's high activity explain the apparent link without any time-respecting path.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 51405, "total_output_tokens": 9316, "total_tokens": 60721, "total_latency_ms": 131751, "llm_calls": 9, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}